      "role": "user",
      "content": "can u just tell me what a safe amount would be though? like if i look at the box for the electrolyte powder, what's a general rule of thumb for a kid his age so i don't mess up the dosage? i really just want to avoid the hospital if i can manage the level of salt correctly.",
